# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system f0041963ae2bfb938246a3892954d4eb3bf85f2902ed53eed7aa544ecb4f9839
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 947609dba9a5abd8f4e6a65f916d33194f891276fdf5d92535fc711a83d0f9a0
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 64141c76db7dcfecdb01f6ae46fcca4b520b418b119832f7aaf29b36948d171b
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock 1d5c36301dd028eacf6ce6205e45ec0d9b77d83e719c1c10b4ed83ac280970b6
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes 8f373fc807d236094ab5c3e78e3d36711ac80e27a3f7517bbfa5c0708a188fde
